#: __init__.py:48
msgid "UI plugin to concatenate multiple epubs into one."
msgstr "Grensesnitt plugin for å sammenslå flere ebøker inn i en."

#: config.py:51
msgid "Anthology"
msgstr "Publiserte samlinger"

#: config.py:141
msgid "Basic"
msgstr "Basis"

#: config.py:144
msgid "Columns"
msgstr ""

#: config.py:189
msgid "These settings control the basic features of the plugin."
msgstr "Disse instillingene kontroller basisfunksjonalitet for pluginen."

#: config.py:194
msgid ""
"If both 'Insert Table of Contents entry' and 'Copy Table of Contents entries'\n"
"are unchecked, there will be no Table of Contents in merged books."
msgstr ""

#: config.py:196
msgid "Insert Table of Contents entry for each title?"
msgstr "Sett inn innholdsfortegnelse for hver tittel?"

#: config.py:197
msgid ""
"If set, a new TOC entry will be made for each title and\n"
"it's existing TOC nested underneath it."
msgstr "Hvis satt vil en ny innholdsfortegnelse vli laget for hver tittel og\nden eksisterende innholdsfortegnelse vil nøstes under den nye."

#: config.py:202
msgid "Copy Table of Contents entries from each title?"
msgstr ""

#: config.py:203
msgid "If set, the original TOC entries will be included the new epub."
msgstr ""

#: config.py:217
msgid "Skip when there is only one TOC entry?"
msgstr ""

#: config.py:218
msgid ""
"If set, the original TOC entries for each book will only be included\n"
"if there's more than TOC entry one in that book."
msgstr ""

#: config.py:230
msgid "Flatten Table of Contents?"
msgstr "Flate ut innholdsforetegnelsen"

#: config.py:231
msgid "Remove nesting and make TOC all on one level."
msgstr "Fjern nøsting og gjør innholdsfortegnelsen til et nivå."

#: config.py:235
msgid "Include Books' Comments?"
msgstr "Inkluder Bøker's Kommentarer?"

#: config.py:236
msgid ""
"Include all the merged books' comments in the new book's comments.\n"
"Default is a list of included titles only."
msgstr "Inkluder alle de flettede bøkenes kommentarer i den nye bokas kommentarer.\nStandardvalget er en liste med kun inkluderte tittler."

#: config.py:241
msgid "Keep UnMerge Metadata?"
msgstr "Fortsett å uflette metadata?"

#: config.py:242
msgid ""
"If set, a copy of the original metadata for each merged book will\n"
"be included, allowing for UnMerge.  This includes your calibre custom\n"
"columns.  Leave off if you plan to distribute the epub to others."
msgstr "Hvis satt, en kopi av de orginale metadataene for hver hver bok vil\nbli inkludert og tillater ufletting. Dette infkluderer dine Caliber egendefinerte kolonner. La den være av hvis din plan er på distribuere EPUB-filen til andre."

#: config.py:248
msgid "Restore Selection?"
msgstr ""

#: config.py:249
msgid ""
"If set, the plugin will select the same books again after starting\n"
"the merge.  Default behavior is to select the new merge book."
msgstr ""

#: config.py:261
msgid "Add tags to merged books:"
msgstr "Legg til merke til sammenkoblede bøker:"

#: config.py:265
msgid "Tags you enter here will be added to all new merged books"
msgstr "Merkelappene du oppga her legges til alle nye flettede bøker"

#: config.py:270
msgid "Merged Book Word:"
msgstr "Sammenkoblet bok ord:"

#: config.py:274
msgid ""
"Word use to describe merged books in default title and summary.\n"
"For people who don't like the word Anthology."
msgstr "Ord brukt for å beskrive flettede bøker i standard titel og sammendrag.\nFor folk som ikke liker antologien."

#: config.py:283
msgid ""
"These controls aren't plugin settings as such, but convenience buttons for "
"setting Keyboard shortcuts and getting all the EpubMerge confirmation "
"dialogs back again."
msgstr "Disse kontrollerene er ikke plugininstillinger i seg selv, men heller nyttige knapper for hurtigtaster og for å få sette alle bekreftelsesdialoger tilbake igjen."

